<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Food Price Index falls 0.7 pct in Dec 1996.</title>
<headline>NZ Food Price Index falls 0.7 pct in Dec 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Friday released the following data for the Food Price Index for December:</p>
<p>    Dec 1996	    Nov 1996		 Dec 1995</p>
<p>    -0.7 pct	    -0.1 pct		 -0.2 pct</p>
<p>    yr-end Dec 1996   yr-end Nov 1996  yr-end Dec 1995</p>
<p>    +1.7 pct	    +2.1 pct		 +0.6 pct</p>
<p>Note - The index makes up 18 percent of the consumer price index (CPI).</p>
<p>Food subgroups, percentage change from the same month of the previous year:  </p>
<p>				    Dec 1996	Nov 1996</p>
<p>    Fruit and Vegetables    -4.2 pct	-2.4 pct</p>
<p>    Meat, fish and poultry  +0.1 pct	+0.9 pct</p>
<p>    Grocery food etc	  +3.5 pct	+3.8 pct</p>
<p>    Restaurants		 +2.0 pct	+2.0 pct</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
